OL,3,GNEWSAYouth project asks for fundraising
OL,4,Asupport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's residents are raising money
OL,7,Ffor a new facility to tackle loneliness
OL,8,Fand support young people's mental
OL,9,Fhealth.
OL,11,FThame Town Council and Thame Youth
OL,12,FProjects are working together to build
OL,13,Fthe centre on the Southern Road
OL,14,FRecreation Area in the Oxfordshire
OL,15,Ftown.
OL,17,FProject Link has secured more than #5m
OL,18,Fin funding towards the construction,
OL,19,Fbut a further #360,000 is still needed
OL,20,Fto make the plans a reality.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
